 4. Training data 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 OpenAI is said to have purchased Glass Imaging, a startup focused on improving smartphone cameras, in a deal that values the company at more than $300 million. (WSJ) Apple released iOS 27 , which includes the updated Siri AI, as well as software updates for Mac, Apple Watch and other devices. (The Verge) Anthropic is still likely to go public in 2026, even as AI safety rockets into the zeitgeist, multiple sources tell Axios' Dan Primack. (Axios) 
 
